WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.662
Lab 2 uses a test tenant;
the authors haven't run it.

2
00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:05.987
Set up the contractor provisioning app,

3
00:00:05.987 --> 00:00:10.213
and grant the middleware the owned-by
upload permission on that app only.

4
00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:14.205
Send two test contractors, one
active and one past its end,

5
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:16.413
and read the provisioning logs.

6
00:00:16.413 --> 00:00:18.038
Reconcile against the tenant:

7
00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:21.288
there should be no finding for
the account you just disabled.

8
00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:25.652
Then apply the review settings by merging
them into the policy you read back,

9
00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:27.938
and confirm the reviewer is the manager.

10
00:00:27.938 --> 00:00:30.890
Finally, restore the policy and clean up.
